# Cast for X = 0 it enters with no charge counters (sunburst counts colors spent, none) and, sacrificed, destroys each nonland
# permanent with mana value 0: Bot1's two Moxen and Bot2's Mox Pearl, tapped or not. Lands have mana value 0 too but are not
# "nonland", so Bot1's and Bot2's Islands survive, as does Bot2's Mind Stone (mana value 2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Engineered Explosives
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Pearl
Mind Stone
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Engineered Explosives.Cast(X: 0)
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Mind Stone.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Engineered Explosives.Counters.Charge = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Engineered Explosives.Activate

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Island
Bot1.Graveyard = Mox Ruby; Mox Jet; Engineered Explosives
Bot2.Battlefield = Island; Mind Stone
Bot2.Graveyard = Mox Pearl
